    <div class="note mt-2">
      <strong>Routing in one line:</strong> match the discharge port to the consignee. Jebel Ali
      suits most Dubai and Northern Emirates destinations, Khalifa suits Abu Dhabi, and Port Khalid
      suits Sharjah and the northern emirates. A cheaper ocean rate at the wrong port can become
      more expensive after inland trucking.
    </div>
