  <section class="section container">
    <h2>7. Sea freight cost composition: the fees competitors skip</h2>
    <p>
      The ocean rate is only one line. THC, documentation, the bill of lading fee, demurrage and
      detention sit on top, and none of those amounts were published in the verified research
      snapshot. The correct comparison number is an itemised all-in quote.
    </p>

    <h3>Demurrage and detention</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>Demurrage</strong> is charged by the terminal when the container stays inside the port
      beyond free time after discharge. <strong>Detention</strong> is charged by the carrier when the
      container stays outside the port beyond free time before return. Free-time allowances and
      per-day charges were not published in the snapshot and vary by terminal and line — request them
      with your quote.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-3">Full sea freight cost stack</h3>
